(890, 1, '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '[vc_row qt_container=\"true\" css=\".vc_custom_1517404240060{padding-top: 23% !important;padding-bottom: 5% !important;}\"][vc_column][kentha-releases-small cols=\"4\" size=\"medium\" title=\"Release grid - variable columns\" quantity=\"3\"][kentha-releases-small cols=\"3\" size=\"medium\" title=\"\" quantity=\"4\"][kentha-releases-small size=\"medium\" title=\"\"][vc_row_inner css=\".vc_custom_1516206088044{padding-top: 3% !important;}\"][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\n<h4>Endless possibilities for your music</h4>\nThis element can display your album releases in a variable number of columns (1 to 6) and you can choose the size of the thumbnails to fit larger designs.\n\nThe query can be adjusted by category, number, offset or also extract by id list.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][kentha-releases-small orderby=\"rand\" cols=\"3\" size=\"medium\" title=\"\" quantity=\"8\" offset=\"6\"][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row]', 'Releases grid', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'releases-grid', '', '', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '2018-01-17 16:26:47', '', 505, 'https://qantumthemes.xyz/kentha/demo1/?page_id=890', 0, 'page', '', 0),
